  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">在使用该魔法武器进行攻击时，你的攻击检定与伤害掷骰获得</span><span class=\"1\">+2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">加值。血斧将对非构装生物或非不死生物额外造成</span><span class=\"1\">1d6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">的黯蚀伤害。当你使用此武器将一个生物的生命值降为</span><span class=\"1\">0</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">时，你将获得</span><span class=\"1\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">点临时生命值。</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">这把斧子由深铁锈色的金属所制成，曾属于歌利亚野蛮人</span><span class=\"1\">Grog Strongjaw of Vox Machina</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
